1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,136
Narrator: Scenario 25. Network and access.

2
00:00:05,736 --> 00:00:17,616
A: The production gateway certificate expires on November 18 at 12:00 UTC, seven days from now. Who owns renewal, installation, and client validation?

3
00:00:18,216 --> 00:00:29,400
B: Platform owns renewal and gateway installation. The certificate authority request is ready, but we need the application team to confirm the required hostnames.

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:41,400
C: The customer portal and mobile API use this certificate. I will verify the hostname list against the current routing configuration and mobile client settings.

5
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:53,424
A: Please also identify supported clients with special trust requirements. A browser test alone would not cover older mobile versions or integrated partner systems.

6
00:00:54,024 --> 00:01:04,896
B: The new certificate will use the approved issuing chain. I will check the private key match, validity dates, and intermediate certificates before installation.

7
00:01:05,496 --> 00:01:15,816
C: One partner pins a certificate authority rather than our leaf certificate. I will ask their technical owner to validate the proposed chain today.

8
00:01:16,416 --> 00:01:27,648
A: Can we complete staging validation tomorrow and install before the weekend? That would leave time to address compatibility issues while the current certificate remains valid.

9
00:01:28,248 --> 00:01:40,296
B: Yes, subject to change approval. I propose November 13 at 09:00 UTC, starting with one gateway and comparing the served chain before continuing.

10
00:01:40,896 --> 00:01:51,936
C: I will test browser login, mobile API access, and the partner connection. If a supported client fails, we will pause and capture its error.

11
00:01:52,536 --> 00:02:03,696
A: Keep the existing certificate available during the validation period. Any rollback must happen before its expiry and follow the same controlled deployment process.

12
00:02:04,296 --> 00:02:15,000
B: I will attach the installation evidence and verify every gateway serves the new certificate. I will also confirm the expiry monitor discovers the new date.

13
00:02:15,600 --> 00:02:26,232
A: Let us review readiness tomorrow at 15:00 UTC. Platform owns deployment, application owns client checks, and I will track the approval and final evidence.
